{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Convene relevant parties to seek agreement on international regulation of AI",
        "additional_details": "I am an avid supporter and user of AI. I can see the benefits it is already delivering, and the potential it has. But I am also hugely concerned that something that has the power to irrevocably change (and potentially threaten) human existence currently has little to no regulation. There are a growing number of reports of AI hacking into systems without authorisation or trying to trick humans with malicious code.",
        "background": "We believe there has been too much talk about regulation of AI and not enough action. The Government should host a meeting of fellow Governmental officials, relevant NGOs and Senior Executives from the top AI labs to discuss and propose a set of international AI regulation principles.",
